# media/ is generated by tools/sync-media.py and is not committed:
# - posters, videos, loops and thumbnails are copies of marketing/posters/out and marketing/video/out
#   (about 25 MB that the repository already holds once);
# - media/demo-loop.mp3 is licensed music ("Fun Vibe" by Dyalla, YouTube Audio Library). The licence
#   does not allow the file to be distributed on its own, so it is deployed with the site and never
#   committed. Without it the demo plays its synthesised fallback.
# Run `python tools/sync-media.py` before previewing or deploying.
media/
